{"name":"Actions Workflows Run Start Delays","status":"resolved","created_at":"2026-01-28T15:12:41.886Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T17:45:22.584Z","monitoring_at":null,"resolved_at":"2026-01-28T15:54:04.612Z","impact":"minor","shortlink":"https://stspg.io/nwn2qh7hrr1y","scheduled_for":null,"scheduled_until":null,"scheduled_remind_prior":false,"scheduled_reminded_at":null,"impact_override":"minor","scheduled_auto_in_progress":false,"scheduled_auto_completed":false,"metadata":{},"started_at":"2026-01-28T15:12:41.877Z","reminder_intervals":null,"id":"22zx8fw9qt4t","page_id":"kctbh9vrtdwd","incident_updates":[{"status":"resolved","body":"On Jan 28, 2026, between 14:56 UTC and 15:44 UTC, GitHub Actions experienced degraded performance. During this time, workflows experienced an average delay of 49 seconds, and 4.7% of workflow runs failed to start within 5 minutes. The root cause was an atypical load pattern that overwhelmed system capacity and caused resource contention.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eRecovery began once additional resources came online at 15:25 UTC, with full recovery at 15:44 UTC. We are implementing safeguards to prevent this failure mode and enhancing our monitoring to detect and address similar patterns more quickly in the future.","created_at":"2026-01-28T15:54:04.612Z","wants_twitter_update":false,"twitter_updated_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-01-30T17:45:22.578Z","display_at":"2026-01-28T15:54:04.612Z","deliver_notifications":true,"tweet_id":null,"id":"8w4qzx16l414","incident_id":"22zx8fw9qt4t","custom_tweet":null,"affected_components":[{"code":"br0l2tvcx85d","name":"Actions","old_status":"partial_outage","new_status":"operational"}]},{"status":"investigating","body":"Actions workflow run starts are delayed. We are actively investigating to find a mitigation.","created_at":"2026-01-28T15:37:54.667Z","wants_twitter_update":false,"twitter_updated_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-01-28T15:37:54.667Z","display_at":"2026-01-28T15:37:54.667Z","deliver_notifica